.png", "id": "1000205379086894", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499315353_1000205382420227_4095144036500123180_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hlo2lwtED70Q7kNvwE6nJ07&_nc_oc=AdrkWdE_uHbGC43MCCW2IagfbLPxftQwzYgrCTlhyLpjraBOAsQv4DpQfZvLWXP10s0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN_YsNmLVj3P1gK4pmEPeSRvDmDgnjTd1Pfjju809agFg&oe=6AD239D8"}, {"file_name": "5555.png", "id": "1351727073524482", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_1351727076857815_4065916727031916051_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B-vwqGD7u5kQ7kNvwETDzLs&_nc_oc=AdpgDFRGQ0jrvDepNUfrCfna6e1zYh3U2zKn9Wwn6WVcdc84-OuENvAReoX3oRQSXPY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNQUD-4eLHBQaw43d51cK1m9ZWlohfDQDA_LN1E1SrJ3w&oe=6AD23A7E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Alt Tag", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Jump into a fast-paced multiplayer experience built around immersive gorilla-style locomotion. Use your arms to climb, swing, launch, and move with momentum-based controls that reward creativity and skill. Explore detailed environments, discover new routes, and compete in exciting matches where movement matters just as much as strategy.\n\nChallenge friends, improve your movement techniques, and master advanced tricks to gain an edge. Whether you're racing across the map, escaping close calls, or pulling off smooth movement combos, every round creates new moments and different ways to play. Easy to learn and endlessly fun to improve at, this is a game where your movement defines your experience.", "short_description": "Swing, climb, and launch yourself through fast-paced multiplayer action using immersive gorilla-style movement. Explore unique maps, master momentum, and challenge friends in chaotic tag matches where movement skill makes all the difference. Easy to jump into, tough to master."}]}, "developer_name": 